※ pl4g-test: compile=fail
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 4220 LANG_TYPE_NOT_A_RESULT

※ Both operators exist to get at the answer inside a value that may not have
※ one.  A value that is not a result has its answer and nothing else, so
※ neither has anything to take out of it.

let hundred: mut u8 = 100u8

fn asking() → u8?:
    hundred?

@[startup]
fn main() → u8:
    @[ignore(5005)]
    hundred ?? 1u8
    0u8
